item.description:
*Originally posted on Facebook, July 4, 2017*

Crucify me as satan
lifted up in You
at the cross, Jesus;

for, cut off from God,

I obey the will of the chief of sinners; satan himself,
and I have worked hard for pleasure;
to earn the full measure of God's wrath;
the concentrated bitter tears of fire and brimstone;
the rain of Jesus' blood
that will destroy the wicked city
of our world and our government and our church
and the wicked throne of my natural heart.

Revelation 21:4  And God shall wipe away all tears from their eyes;
and there shall be no more death, neither sorrow, nor crying,
neither shall there be any more pain:
for the former things are passed away.

*Originally posted on Facebook, July 6, 2017*

Praise the LORD for freedom of speech;
Truth casts out fear
